WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:04,100
How high is the price

2
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:05,930
Then I don't know

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,730
Anyway, it should be higher than what you gave me.

4
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:15,770
Uncle Jianjun

5
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:17,890
Do you really want to go directly there and cause trouble?

6
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,370
My brother-in-law’s fists are no joke

7
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,770
You little bastard

8
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,650
You have eaten the heart of a bear and the courage of a leopard.

9
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:38,750
You actually said that I don’t want to say goodbye to my little ancestor

10
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:40,150
I won’t hit you, okay?

11
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,470
Don't shout

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,060
If you want to buy my uncle's boat

13
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:47,980
Just offer a high price

14
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,500
As long as the price is higher than others

15
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,820
My uncle will definitely sell it to you
